            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.178649237472767,
            "y": 12.910611231371064,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>The Origins of the Blockade</strong><br>\nThe blockade of the Gaza Strip began in 2007 when the political group Hamas took control of the area. Israel and Egypt responded by closing their borders to restrict the movement of people and goods. The primary reason for this blockade was security concerns, as Hamas is classified as a terrorist organization.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Humanitarian Challenges</strong><br>\nThe blockade has led to serious humanitarian challenges. The residents of Gaza have limited access to basic needs such as food, water, and medical care. Additionally, unemployment is high, and many people live in poverty.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Healthcare</strong><br>\nThe healthcare system in Gaza is severely affected by the blockade. There is a shortage of medical supplies and trained personnel. Furthermore, medical facilities are overcrowded and often in poor condition.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
        ],
        "slideBackgroundSelector": {}
      },
      {
        "elements": [
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 4.415011037527593,
            "width": 37.98882681564246,
            "height": 8.830022075055187,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:1.5em;\"><strong>INFORMATION TEXT (Part 2)</strong></span></p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "55aaf4d3-f7e3-4a3e-9196-01a6f7474f94"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582782,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Education</strong><br>\nThe education sector is also suffering due to the blockade. Schools and universities are often damaged and poorly equipped. Moreover, many children and adolescents suffer from psychological issues due to violence and insecurity, which impacts their learning ability.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Economic Impact</strong><br>\nThe economy of Gaza has shrunk significantly due to the blockade. Trade restrictions and high unemployment have led to widespread impoverishment among the population. Many people rely on humanitarian aid to meet their basic needs.</p>\n\n<p><strong>International Reactions</strong><br>\nThe international community has frequently criticized the blockade and called for its lifting. Many countries and organizations see the blockade as collective punishment, disproportionately affecting the civilian population.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "3b13867b-feab-4e2e-bfa2-fcc82e4dbff1"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
        ],
