          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582782,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Attempts to Alleviate the Blockade</strong><br>\nThere have been some attempts to mitigate the humanitarian impact of the blockade. This includes the delivery of humanitarian aid by international organizations. Nevertheless, the fundamental issues remain, and living conditions in Gaza continue to be extremely difficult.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Political Impact</strong><br>\nThe blockade has also exacerbated the political situation in Gaza and the surrounding region. It has strained relations between the different Palestinian political groups as well as between Israel and the Palestinians.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Hope for a Solution</strong><br>\nThere is hope for resolving the situation through political negotiations and international mediation. Many people believe that lifting the blockade and improving relations between the involved parties are crucial for the future of the Gaza Strip and its residents.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "3d655444-fd55-42f7-aba2-16a16db7dc58"
